1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,580
(Raj:)to let people in.

2
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:04,640
(Sheldon:)Listen to what Mr. Wil
Wheaton is tweeting.

3
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:08,510
"Best seats in house
for Raiders screening.

4
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:11,640
Suck on that, Sheldon Cooper."

5
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:13,410
(Leonard:)Why do you read
his Twitter feed?

6
00:00:13,410 --> 00:00:15,260
(Leonard:)You know it's only
going to upset you.

7
00:00:15,270 --> 00:00:17,620
(Sheldon:)I believe in knowing
my enemy, Leonard.

8
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:20,970
(Sheldon:)Had Twitter existed at the time,
would not General Custer

9
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:23,260
(Sheldon:)have followed the tweets
of Sitting Bull?

10
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:25,690
(Sheldon:)Would not Lee have
followed Grant?

11
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:28,260
(Sheldon:)Would not Spy have followed Spy?

12
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,930
(Sheldon:)I have more examples,
but excuse me.

13
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:33,600
(Sheldon:)Hello.

14
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:36,000
(Sheldon:)Well, this seems
like an odd time

15
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,570
(Sheldon:)to test my cell phone quality,
but go on.

16
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:42,010
(Sheldon:)Test phrases? All right.

17
00:00:42,810 --> 00:00:44,740
(Sheldon:)Imatote.

18
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:46,780
Ulba.

19
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:48,550
(Sheldon:)Twad.

20
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:51,120
(Sheldon:)All together?

21
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:53,590
(Sheldon:)I'm a total buttwad.

22
00:00:55,920 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)Why are you laughing?

